      "my_answer": "Conservative care: gentle shampooing, application of emollient/mineral oil to soften scales, gentle removal with a soft brush, and avoidance of picking or harsh scrubbing.",
      "rationale": "Cradle cap typically resolves with simple measures. Antifungal or mild topical corticosteroid shampoos are reserved for persistent or extensive cases."
